OL,3,GNEWSAHomes evacuated after car crashes
OL,4,Ainto house
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of homes were evacuated after
OL,7,Fa car crashed into the back of a house
OL,8,Fin Shrewsbury, causing a gas leak.
OL,10,FWest Mercia Police said it was called
OL,11,Fto the property on Upper Road at about
OL,12,F13:38 GMT on Saturday and a cordon had
OL,13,Fbeen put in place.
OL,15,FIt said Hereford Road had been closed
OL,16,Fto allow the emergency services to
OL,17,Fcarry out their work.
OL,19,FShropshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,20,Fconfirmed it had also been called.
